From: Waltteri Hooli <1420194+wahooli@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: cq8725s-ayn-odin3: add the display CESTA

Describe the display RSC, its CESTA resource manager, the SCC wrapper and
the MDSS GDSC register for the suspend handoff in 9023, at the addresses
armada-os/armada 008e910 used. With it the Odin 3 reaches AOSS deep sleep.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/cq8725s-ayn-odin3.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/cq8725s-ayn-odin3.dts
@@ -424,3 +424,18 @@
 		};
 	};
 };
+
+/* Display CESTA handoff at suspend (9023), for AOSS deep sleep */
+/ {
+	display-cesta@af20000 {
+		compatible = "armada,sm8750-disp-cesta";
+		reg = <0x0 0x0af20000 0x0 0x1000>,
+		      <0x0 0x0af21000 0x0 0x7000>,
+		      <0x0 0x0af30000 0x0 0x7000>,
+		      <0x0 0x0af09000 0x0 0x8>;
+		reg-names = "rscc", "crm", "wrapper", "gdsc";
+		power-domains = <&rpmhpd RPMHPD_MMCX>;
+		required-opps = <&rpmhpd_opp_low_svs>;
+		armada,mdss = <&mdss>;
+	};
+};
